259
00:18:00,060 --> 00:18:03,295
In that case, I owe our little
friend a word of praise!

260
00:18:03,600 --> 00:18:07,835
He's the first person who's ever
managed to put a scratch on one of you!

261
00:18:10,260 --> 00:18:13,780
Mama, do you plan to keep
that skeleton here forever?

262
00:18:14,420 --> 00:18:15,380
That skeleton?

263
00:18:16,080 --> 00:18:17,217
Pudding, I'm appalled.

264
00:18:17,300 --> 00:18:19,124
Is that really all I am to you?

265
00:18:19,440 --> 00:18:20,920
Yes, certainly.

266
00:18:21,440 --> 00:18:22,270
Dear Claus.

267
00:18:22,353 --> 00:18:24,097
This is a one-of-a-kind work of art.

268
00:18:24,180 --> 00:18:26,062
I can't hide him away in a book.

269
00:18:27,640 --> 00:18:31,220
So instead, I think I'll
carry it around for a while.

270
00:18:31,780 --> 00:18:32,610
Please, no.

271
00:18:32,860 --> 00:18:35,777
By the way, my dear,
you've done well yourself.

272
00:18:35,860 --> 00:18:38,417
I was surprised to find out the Straw Hats

273
00:18:38,500 --> 00:18:40,971
made their way through the seducing woods.

274
00:18:41,160 --> 00:18:45,620
But now they're safely sealed
inside a book in the prison library.

275
00:18:47,100 --> 00:18:53,420
I know I went there to see them; it really
serves them right, serves them for right.

276
00:18:53,980 --> 00:18:57,880
Are you going to kill them of
course once the weddings over?

277
00:18:58,120 --> 00:19:02,517
I also took the liberty of sending
bar mates to everyone in germa.

278
00:19:02,600 --> 00:19:06,637
They're all so Intoxicated, we could
slip anything under their noses.

279
00:19:06,720 --> 00:19:10,677
Good, but you should know: raise
you was snooping around me earlier.

280
00:19:10,760 --> 00:19:13,177
She's very perceptive.

281
00:19:13,260 --> 00:19:15,457
I already took care of it, though.

282
00:19:15,540 --> 00:19:17,537
What's that?

283
00:19:17,620 --> 00:19:19,537
You didn't kill her, did you?

284
00:19:19,620 --> 00:19:21,317
Don't be ridiculous, mama.

285
00:19:21,400 --> 00:19:23,577
Sometimes, I feel like
you don't trust me at all.

286
00:19:23,660 --> 00:19:26,817
No, I simply shot her in the
leg and erased her memory.

287
00:19:26,900 --> 00:19:29,580
I must be misunderstanding somehow.

288
00:19:34,980 --> 00:19:38,156
Pudding, all this time I
thought you were a nice girl.

289
00:19:40,340 --> 00:19:41,840
Be careful, dear.

290
00:19:42,300 --> 00:19:44,777
You're our precious
little bride, after all.

291
00:19:44,860 --> 00:19:48,095
If she tries to get revenge,
there could be a disaster.

292
00:19:48,260 --> 00:19:50,600
I appreciate your concern, Mama.

293
00:19:51,260 --> 00:19:55,940
But, thanks to her, I got a
chance to practice using my gun.

294
00:19:57,080 --> 00:19:59,997
Even the artificially
modified people of Germa

295
00:20:00,080 --> 00:20:02,560
won't be able to survive a shot from this.

296
00:20:05,600 --> 00:20:07,940
You are such a clever little girl.

297
00:20:08,240 --> 00:20:10,140
Then again, you are my daughter.

298
00:20:13,080 --> 00:20:17,460
Tomorrow, your gunfire will
set my genius plan into motion.

299
00:20:18,380 --> 00:20:20,040
I can't wait.

300
00:20:20,840 --> 00:20:24,080
Everyone's attention will
be on the big wedding kiss.

301
00:20:24,300 --> 00:20:28,160
That's when Sanji, probably
with a foolish grin on his face,

302
00:20:28,360 --> 00:20:30,977
will slowly lift the veil over your head.

303
00:20:31,060 --> 00:20:34,897
And then, much to his shock and horror.

304
00:20:34,980 --> 00:20:37,720
He will discover you have a third eye.

305
00:20:42,460 --> 00:20:44,997
He expected a beautiful face.

306
00:20:45,080 --> 00:20:49,160
But now he sees his bride for
the monster that she truly is.

307
00:20:50,000 --> 00:20:52,157
He'll be paralyzed with shock.

308
00:20:52,240 --> 00:20:55,097
And that's your window of opportunity.

309
00:20:55,180 --> 00:20:57,697
Suddenly you'll take out your gun.

310
00:20:57,780 --> 00:21:00,757
Aim right between those curly eyebrows.

311
00:21:00,840 --> 00:21:02,320
and shoot!

312
00:21:06,900 --> 00:21:07,730
What?

313
00:21:08,700 --> 00:21:10,880
Somebody is going to kill Sanji?

314
00:21:11,180 --> 00:21:13,651
All of the wedding guests will be stunned.

315
00:21:13,940 --> 00:21:15,352
They won't move an inch.

316
00:21:15,520 --> 00:21:17,755
Soon the people of Germa will cry out.

317
00:21:17,860 --> 00:21:20,260
They'll turn around and try to run away.

318
00:21:20,520 --> 00:21:22,240
But it'll be far too late.

319
00:21:23,460 --> 00:21:27,060
A wall of gun barrels will
be pointed at the Vinsmokes,

320
00:21:27,160 --> 00:21:29,101
who showed up completely unarmed.

321
00:21:31,780 --> 00:21:34,260
And before they realize the danger,

322
00:21:34,460 --> 00:21:39,117
the floor will be drenched in blood and
endless cacophony of gunshots fills the

323
00:21:39,200 --> 00:21:43,729
wedding hall as their bodies are pelted
with bullets even after they're dead.

324
00:21:44,120 --> 00:21:49,540
All six bin smokes will lie motionless
on the floor in a pool of crimson.

325
00:21:51,020 --> 00:21:53,720
More gunshots will sound off in salute,

326
00:21:53,920 --> 00:21:57,077
and that's when the real
celebration can begin.

327
00:21:57,160 --> 00:22:01,240
We'll devour the wedding cake
and wash it down with some tea.

328
00:22:02,700 --> 00:22:06,217
After they've been stripped of
that useless leader of theirs.

329
00:22:06,300 --> 00:22:09,277
I can claim Germa for my own.

330
00:22:09,360 --> 00:22:12,040
And their forces will be mine to command.

331
00:22:16,340 --> 00:22:19,620
Poor Joe, bro, does it hurt? I'm fine.

332
00:22:20,400 --> 00:22:22,337
Wow, this is so weird!

333
00:22:22,420 --> 00:22:23,857
We're inside the mirror?

334
00:22:23,940 --> 00:22:27,380
You should be ashamed taking
up with such a wretched crew.

335
00:22:27,640 --> 00:22:28,800
Hello, Barrel.

336
00:22:29,020 --> 00:22:31,680
This is treason, there's
no doubt about it.

337
00:22:33,240 --> 00:22:36,360
I had heard that you tried
to abandon our operation,

338
00:22:36,620 --> 00:22:39,738
but Mama brought out the
roulette and you got scared.

339
00:22:41,900 --> 00:22:44,437
I owed a serious debt
to Mama for protecting

340
00:22:44,520 --> 00:22:47,108
Fishman Island after
Whitebeard passed away.

341
00:22:47,240 --> 00:22:51,337
So I believe that it was only right
for me to repay her actions in full.

342
00:22:51,420 --> 00:22:56,000
But looking at that roulette wheel,
I could only see death and evil.

343
00:22:57,240 --> 00:22:58,740
Huh? Roulette?

344
00:22:59,180 --> 00:23:02,640
You Karoo were wise not to
spin it, first son of the sea.

345
00:23:04,320 --> 00:23:08,260
Five years ago, my partner was
faced with spinning that wheel,

346
00:23:08,460 --> 00:23:11,460
hoping that he might be
saved from Big Mom's wrath.

347
00:23:11,660 --> 00:23:14,300
But instead, she stole away his life.

348
00:23:15,020 --> 00:23:20,320
Believe me, it's designed in such a way
that whoever spins it is sure to die.

349
00:23:20,680 --> 00:23:21,777
The game's wrecked!

350
00:23:21,860 --> 00:23:23,036
That's so messed up!

351
00:23:25,180 --> 00:23:27,300
What did you expect, you fools?

352
00:23:27,580 --> 00:23:30,345
Mama rarely lets anyone
leave this place alive.

353
00:23:30,440 --> 00:23:36,400
Whether it's a mere trespasser or a
traitorous pirate who was once in her service.

354
00:23:37,060 --> 00:23:42,120
She welcomes those who come to her
and kills those who try to leave.

355
00:23:42,880 --> 00:23:44,260
That's Mama's way.

356
00:23:44,460 --> 00:23:45,813
We're wasting our time.

357
00:23:49,520 --> 00:23:50,814
Let's get out of here.

358
00:23:50,920 --> 00:23:53,857
We have to hurry up and find
Luffy, Sanji, and Brooke.

359
00:23:53,940 --> 00:23:55,057
Hey, that's not fair!

360
00:23:55,140 --> 00:23:57,552
You're drastically over the weight limit!

361
00:24:11,240 --> 00:24:12,070
Yes,

362
00:24:12,153 --> 00:24:14,137
we can confirm with
absolute certainty that

363
00:24:14,220 --> 00:24:16,297
the groom is fast asleep in his quarters.

364
00:24:16,380 --> 00:24:18,617
Make sure that he doesn't
go out until morning,

365
00:24:18,700 --> 00:24:21,957
and keep constant watch to ensure
that no one else goes in either.

366
00:24:22,040 --> 00:24:22,870
Right.

367
00:24:28,300 --> 00:24:29,130
Huh?

368
00:24:29,280 --> 00:24:30,357
Well, ain't that a thing?

369
00:24:30,440 --> 00:24:31,280
I fell asleep!

370
00:24:31,480 --> 00:24:33,140
And in the groom's bed, too!

371
00:24:34,080 --> 00:24:34,920
That's funny.

372
00:24:35,220 --> 00:24:37,220
I thought he would be back by now.

373
00:24:38,200 --> 00:24:40,700
I guess he's got other stuff to do.

374
00:24:41,560 --> 00:24:42,390
Oh, well.

375
00:24:42,600 --> 00:24:44,980
Time to catch a few more Zs.

376
00:24:45,520 --> 00:24:46,350
Let's see.

377
00:24:46,620 --> 00:24:48,997
Peckums was with them until
they entered our territory.

378
00:24:49,080 --> 00:24:52,337
We know that their objective
is to get Sanji back.

379
00:24:52,420 --> 00:24:54,157
And that there were six of them.

380
00:24:54,240 --> 00:24:56,769
when Pudding lured them
to the island here.

381
00:24:57,900 --> 00:25:01,400
So King is with Mama, which
means that he's accounted for.

382
00:25:02,200 --> 00:25:03,030
Hands off!

383
00:25:03,220 --> 00:25:06,357
And Pedro blew himself up in
the third floor courtyard.

384
00:25:06,440 --> 00:25:07,270
Is that right?

385
00:25:09,840 --> 00:25:10,860
That's two down.

386
00:25:11,440 --> 00:25:13,897
Then out of the four who
went into the seducing woods,

387
00:25:13,980 --> 00:25:16,497
we can check off the
rabbit and the raccoon.

388
00:25:16,580 --> 00:25:19,462
At noon, we received a
report from Big Sis Barrel,

389
00:25:19,680 --> 00:25:21,937
telling us that she
had captured them both.

390
00:25:22,020 --> 00:25:25,314
So then that takes care of
four out of the original six.

391
00:25:25,460 --> 00:25:26,980
Which leaves these two.

392
00:25:28,920 --> 00:25:31,080
They beat our big brother, Cracker,

393
00:25:31,280 --> 00:25:34,280
and then managed to escape
from the seducing woods.

394
00:25:34,440 --> 00:25:36,760
But I know, beyond a shadow of a doubt,

395
00:25:36,900 --> 00:25:40,076
we can find them safe and
sound in the prison library.

396
00:25:42,220 --> 00:25:45,420
So why are we hearing
rumors that they broke free?

397
00:26:15,960 --> 00:26:18,517
All before I was
torturing them to find out

398
00:26:18,600 --> 00:26:21,097
Lola's location just
like mama wanted me to.

399
00:26:21,180 --> 00:26:26,057
They didn't know anything useful,
so I had to burn them to death.

400
00:26:26,140 --> 00:26:28,617
I realized that I went a little too far.

401
00:26:28,700 --> 00:26:35,317
But come on, monthor—can't you at least
trust the word of your own brother?

402
00:26:35,400 --> 00:26:37,957
Of course, I trust you!

403
00:26:38,040 --> 00:26:38,870
you

404
00:26:42,120 --> 00:26:44,340
I can't admit my mistake. Never.

405
00:26:44,760 --> 00:26:48,037
If Mama finds out, she'll take
the rest of my lifespan away.

406
00:26:48,120 --> 00:26:49,120
I'll be done for.

407
00:26:52,500 --> 00:26:54,940
And what about Sanji and the Vinsmokes?

408
00:26:55,180 --> 00:26:57,797
We've confirmed that they're
all inside their rooms.

409
00:26:57,880 --> 00:26:59,586
All right, everything's good.

410
00:27:00,500 --> 00:27:02,677
All of the intruders have been captured,

411
00:27:02,760 --> 00:27:05,077
and the preparations
for tomorrow's ceremony

412
00:27:05,160 --> 00:27:07,277
are being made in the kitchen as we speak.

413
00:27:07,360 --> 00:27:11,397
Now let's give our adorable
sister an incredible wedding day!

414
00:27:11,480 --> 00:27:14,304
We'll make sure it all
goes off without a hitch.

415
00:27:28,120 --> 00:27:30,877
Expand your coverage and
patrol until morning!

416
00:27:30,960 --> 00:27:35,400
I can't take opera's word for it.

417
00:27:50,820 --> 00:27:54,040
Hang on, did I cook
this stuff for pudding?

418
00:27:55,480 --> 00:27:57,020
Man, what was I thinking?

419
00:28:09,980 --> 00:28:12,377
I made all their favorites out of habit,

420
00:28:12,460 --> 00:28:18,677
forget them—you have to!

421
00:28:18,760 --> 00:28:25,517
I don't

422
00:28:25,600 --> 00:28:30,097
have to worry

423
00:28:30,180 --> 00:28:31,377
about Luffy and the others;

424
00:28:31,460 --> 00:28:33,877
they'll get away on their own.

425
00:28:33,960 --> 00:28:37,577
The evil army of Vinsmokes will die,

426
00:28:37,660 --> 00:28:41,217
myself included—just the
way Big Mom planned it.

427
00:28:41,300 --> 00:28:42,917
It's for the best.

428
00:28:43,000 --> 00:28:43,830
If she

429
00:28:44,020 --> 00:28:45,937
gets what she wants,
it'll put an end to this,

430
00:28:46,020 --> 00:28:49,617
even if my life was short—at
least it was a fulfilling one!

431
00:28:49,700 --> 00:28:50,530
Oh boy, food!

432
00:28:50,613 --> 00:28:52,537
Hey,

433
00:28:52,620 --> 00:28:57,657
wait a second—are you Sanji Vinsmoke?

434
00:28:57,740 --> 00:29:01,137
My door said you were asleep in...

435
00:29:01,220 --> 00:29:02,279
you were asleep in

436
00:29:03,780 --> 00:29:06,368
I'm gonna keep waiting
for you to come back!

437
00:29:06,580 --> 00:29:11,120
And if you leave me here,
I'll just starve to death!

438
00:29:12,100 --> 00:29:13,820
Get your hands off.

439
00:29:15,360 --> 00:29:16,720
You heard me.

440
00:29:19,680 --> 00:29:21,680
That food's not for you!

441
00:29:33,100 --> 00:29:33,937
There was a noise!

442
00:29:34,020 --> 00:29:34,850
Over there!

443
00:29:40,940 --> 00:29:42,620
How dare you!

444
00:29:48,100 --> 00:29:49,688
Don't you run away from me!

445
00:29:55,180 --> 00:29:56,820
What the hell am I doing?
